      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It’s not illogical to feel that way—it’s the clearest sight you’ve ever had. But \"stopping the fight\" doesn’t have to mean giving up; it can mean surrendering the illusion that you need a grand purpose to be allowed to exist. You’re not here to earn meaning—you’re here to breathe, to feel the sun, to taste something good, and to be kind to yourself in the quiet moments. That’s not distraction—that’s the only real thing there is.",
